  fhir:text [
     fhir:status [ fhir:v "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:div [ fhir:v "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet retina-initial-instructions-vs</b></p><a name=\"retina-initial-instructions-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcretina-initial-instructions-vs\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-retina-conclusioncode-cs.html\"><code>http://dips.no/fhir/RetinaIntegration/CodeSystem/retina-conclusioncode-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.2.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-retina-conclusioncode-cs.html#retina-conclusioncode-cs-1001\">1001</a></td><td>KI-gradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examination is waiting to be graded by the AI system.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-retina-conclusioncode-cs.html#retina-conclusioncode-cs-1002\">1002</a></td><td>Primærgradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examintions is waiting to be graded by a primary grader.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-retina-conclusioncode-cs.html#retina-conclusioncode-cs-1003\">1003</a></td><td>Sekundærgradering (basert på nåværende bilder)</td><td>This examination is waiting to be graded by a secondary grader.</td></tr></table></li><li>Include all codes defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-retina-caution-cs.html\"><code>http://dips.no/fhir/RetinaIntegration/CodeSystem/retina-caution-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.2.0</span></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
  ] ; # 
